<Layout title="Membership | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Membership</div><h1>One simple membership.</h1><p class="lead">Everything below, for one student, with no per-visit surprises. [CONFIRM BILLING MODEL]</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="price"><div class="card"><h3>Per semester</h3><div class="big">[PRICE]</div><p>Direct access, visits, check-ins, care coordination.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Per year</h3><div class="big">[PRICE]</div><p>[ANNUAL DISCOUNT]</p></div></div><p class="note">Membership is not health insurance. Keep your student's coverage for labs, specialists, and emergencies.</p></div>
<section><div class="w"><h2 style="margin-bottom:20px">Questions parents ask</h2>
<details><summary>How is this different from the campus clinic?</summary><p>Campus clinics are built for quick, episodic visits. We provide ongoing, personalized care with a doctor who knows your student.</p></details>
<details><summary>Will you share my student's information with me?</summary><p>Only what your student agrees to share. That's what makes them comfortable being honest with us.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does this replace insurance?</summary><p>No. [INSURANCE DETAILS, CONFIRM WITH YOUR ATTORNEY]</p></details>
<details><summary>What if my student is away from Blacksburg?</summary><p>In-person care in Blacksburg is our core. Telehealth depends on where your student is located. [TELEHEALTH DETAILS]</p></details>
<details><summary>What if it's an emergency?</summary><p>Call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room. Then let us know, and we'll help with follow-up.</p></details></div></section>
</Layout>
